    346  3c82							; ------------------------------------------------------------ SysEx: a patch from Chip Lab (v0.20)
    347  3c82							; (v0.23: F0 7D 46 43 02 m F7 sets the chips on / off: DevicesReceived)
    348  3c82							; F0 7D 46 43 01 PATCH_SIZE, then the patch (PATCH_SIZE bytes, the live patch's layout:
    349  3c82							; tools/gen_patches.py) as two 4-bit halves each, high first, then F7. It
    350  3c82							; arrives in sxBuf; only a complete one goes into the live patch, which then
    351  3c82							; sounds at once (like choosing a sound). Anything else is ignored.
    352  3c82		       00 05	   SX_HEAD    equ	5
    353  3c82		       00 db	   SX_LEN     equ	SX_HEAD + PATCH_SIZE * 2
    354  3c82
    355  3c82							; A status byte in A (F0-F7); keeps A
    356  3c82				   SysexStatus
